french.NVGM_MONEY_CREDIT:
#tooltip_header [concept_money]#!
#white $BALANCE$：#!@money!#bold [Country.PredictWeeklyBalance|1=+D]#!
[concept_gold_reserves]: #tooltippable #tooltip:GOLD_RESERVES_BREAKDOWN @money![Country.GetGoldReserves|Dv]#!#!
[concept_credit]: #tooltippable #tooltip:CREDIT_PROGRESS #variable @money![Country.GetPrincipal|K]#!#!#! / #maximum [Country.GetMaxCredit|K]#!
$TOOLTIP_DELIMITER$
#header $NATIONAL_REVENUE$ ：#!#variable @money![Country.PredictWeeklyIncome|D+=]#!
　@money![Country.GetIncomeTaxIncome|D+=] $BUDGET_INCOME_TAXES$
　@money![Country.GetPollTaxIncome|D+=] $BUDGET_POLL_TAXES$
　@money![Country.PredictConsumptionTaxes|D+=] $BUDGET_CONSUMPTION_TAXES$
　@money![Country.PredictDividendsTaxes|D+=] $BUDGET_DIVIDENDS_TAXES$
　@money![Country.PredictTariffs|D+=] $BUDGET_TARIFFS$
　@money![Country.PredictMinting|D+=] $BUDGET_MINTING$
　@money![Country.PredictGovernmentShareDividends|D+=] $DIVIDENDS_FROM_GOVERNMENT_SHARES$
　@money![Country.GetModifier.GetValueFor('country_tax_income_add')|D+=] $BUDGET_ADDITIONAL_INCOME$

#bold #white Temporary National Revenue ：#!#bold #P @money!+[Country.GetWeeklyTemporaryIncome|D+]#!#!
　@money![Country.GetWeeklyTemporaryIncome|D+=] [concept_budget_investment_income]

#header $NATIONAL_EXPENSES$ ：#!#variable #bold #N @money!-[Country.GetWeeklyExpenses|D-]#!#!
　#N @money!-[Country.PredictGovernmentWagesExpenses|D-]#! $BUDGET_GOVERNMENT_WAGES$
　#N @money!-[Country.GetGovernmentGoodsExpenses|D-]#! $BUDGET_GOODS_FOR_GOVERNMENT_BUILDINGS$
　#N @money!-[Country.PredictMilitaryWagesExpenses|D-]#! $BUDGET_MILITARY_WAGES$
　#N @money!-[Country.GetMilitaryGoodsExpenses|D-]#! $BUDGET_GOODS_FOR_MILITARY_BUILDINGS$
　#N @money!-[Country.GetWelfarePaymentsExpenses|D-]#! $BUDGET_WELFARE_PAYMENTS$
　#N @money!-[Country.GetSubsidiesExpenses|D-]#! $BUDGET_SUBSIDIES$
　#N @money!-[Country.PredictGovernmentShareLosses|D-]#! $LOSSES_FROM_GOVERNMENT_SHARES$

#bold Temporary National Expenses ：#!#bold #N @money!-[Country.GetWeeklyTemporaryExpenses|D-]#!#!
　#N @money!-[Country.GetWeeklyTemporaryExpenses|D-]#! [concept_budget_construction_goods]

Balance (excluding Temporary Income and Expenses)：#v @money![Country.PredictBalanceWithoutTemporaryIncomeAndExpenses|D+=]#!

